# Gradle Dependencies

## Policy

You may add Gradle dependencies needed for the task. Prefer well-maintained, widely-used libraries.

## Common Dependencies for This Project

| Purpose | Dependency | Notes |
|---------|------------|-------|
| CSV parsing | `org.apache.commons:commons-csv` | Streaming-friendly |
| CLI args | `info.picocli:picocli` | Or `commons-cli` |
| Logging | `org.slf4j:slf4j-api` + `ch.qos.logback:logback-classic` | SLF4J facade |
| Testing | `org.assertj:assertj-core` | Fluent assertions |
| BigDecimal utilities | Built-in `java.math.BigDecimal` | No extra dep |

## Adding Dependencies

Add to `dependencies { }` in `build.gradle.kts`:

```kotlin
dependencies {
    implementation("org.apache.commons:commons-csv:1.10.0")
    implementation("info.picocli:picocli:4.7.5")
    implementation("org.slf4j:slf4j-api:2.0.9")
    runtimeOnly("ch.qos.logback:logback-classic:1.4.14")

    testImplementation(platform("org.junit:junit-bom:5.10.2"))
    testImplementation("org.junit.jupiter:junit-jupiter")
    testImplementation("org.assertj:assertj-core:3.24.2")
}
```

## Version Management

- Use explicit versions or BOM (e.g. `platform(...)`) for consistency
- Prefer recent stable versions from Maven Central
